<title>MAURITIUS: MAURITIUS RUPEE WEAKENS AGAINST DOLLAR.</title>
<headline>MAURITIUS RUPEE WEAKENS AGAINST DOLLAR.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened slightly against the dollar and strengthened against sterling on Wednesday, reflecting international market trends, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was posted at a mean commercial rate of 21.839 to the dollar from 21.7665 on Tuesday, and at 35.4835 to the pound sterling from 35.5135.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien ++230 211-9555</p>
